  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/bew8vc92mn",
  "title": "设置 AdSense 中 Anchor Ads 始终展示在页面底部",
  "author": "6",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/bew8vc92mn_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "Adsense",
    "经验"
  ],
  "content": "<div><strong>如果你希望 Anchor Ads 始终展示在页面底部，在页面嵌入的广告代码中添加 data-overlays=\"bottom\" 参数即可。</strong></div>\n<div>Anchor Ads 是 AdSense 中常用的一种广告形式。在 PC 端通常展示在页面底部，几乎不会影响用户体验；但是在移动端，默认会展示在页面顶部，我个人不喜欢，尽管官方说展示在顶部效果更好。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/bew8vc92mn_img1.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-12-24 at 16.53.47.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n如果你希望 Anchor Ads 始终展示在页面底部，在页面嵌入的广告代码中添加 <strong>data-overlays=\"bottom\"</strong> 参数即可，例如：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&lt;</span><span>head</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&gt;</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&lt;</span><span>script </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">async</span><span> src</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-1234567890123456\"</span><span> data</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>overlays</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"bottom\"</span><span> crossorigin</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"anonymous\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&gt;</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>script</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&gt;</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>head</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&gt;</span></code></div></pre>\n<div>官方参考文档：<a href=\"https://support.google.com/adsense/answer/7478225?hl=en&amp;ref_topic=9261304&amp;sjid=9177587757664520551-NC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://support.google.com/adsense/answer/7478225?hl=en&amp;ref_topic=9261304&amp;sjid=9177587757664520551-NC</a></div>",
